OL,3,GNEWSANo cost of living payment for NI
OL,4,Auntil Stormont budget agreed, says
OL,5,ABryant
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe secretary of state has warned that
OL,8,Fa cost of living payment cannot be made
OL,9,Fin Northern Ireland until an executive
OL,10,Fbudget is agreed.
OL,12,FIt comes after the Chancellor John
OL,13,FHealey announced the #100 payment for
OL,14,Fhouseholds in England, based on how
OL,15,Fmuch council tax they pay.
OL,17,FDelivering his first Budget, Healey
OL,18,Fsaid money would be made available to
OL,19,FStormont to fund an equivalent scheme.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
